{"id":"H8113","lemma":"שִׁמְרִי","transliteration":"shimri","sayIt":"shim-RI","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Shimri","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Simeon(?) living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1Ch.4.37;\nson of: Shemaiah (H8098C);\nfather of: Jedaiah (H3042)\n§ Shimri = \"vigilant\"\n1) a Simeonite, son of Shemaiah and father of Jedaiah\n2) father of Jediael, one of David's mighty warriors\n3) a Merarite Levite, son of Hosah\n4) a Kohathite Levite of the sons of Elizaphan","glosses":["shimri"],"count":4,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1ch-4","v":37,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Shimri","kjv":"of Shimri"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-11","v":45,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Shimri","kjv":"of Shimri"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-26","v":10,"renderings":{"bsb":"Shimri","kjv":"Simri"}},{"chapterId":"2ch-29","v":13,"renderings":{"bsb":"Shimri","kjv":"Shimri"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Chronicles 4:37","note":"and Ziza the son of Shiphi, the son of Allon, the son of Jedaiah, the son of Shimri, the son of Shemaiah—","source":"web"},{"ref":"2 Chronicles 29:13","note":"and of the sons of Elizaphan, Shimri and Jeuel; and of the sons of Asaph, Zechariah and Mattaniah;","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H2148","lemma":"זְכַרְיָהוּ","transliteration":"zekharyah","gloss":"Zechariah"},{"id":"H2518","lemma":"חִלְקִיָּהוּ","transliteration":"chilqiyyah","gloss":"Hilkiah"},{"id":"H2621","lemma":"חֹסָה","transliteration":"chosah","gloss":"Hosah"},{"id":"H2882","lemma":"טְבַלְיָ֫הוּ","transliteration":"tevalyahu","gloss":"Tebaliah"},{"id":"H3042","lemma":"יְדָיָה","transliteration":"yedayah","gloss":"Jedaiah"},{"id":"H3043","lemma":"יְדִיעֲאֵל","transliteration":"yediael","gloss":"Jediael"},{"id":"H3109","lemma":"יוֹחָא","transliteration":"yoach","gloss":"Joha"},{"id":"H8098","lemma":"שְׁמַעְיָ֫הוּ","transliteration":"shemayah","gloss":"Shemaiah"}],"senses":[{"id":"H8113H","gloss":"Shimri","relation":"H8113H ="},{"id":"H8113I","gloss":"Shimri","relation":"H8113I ="},{"id":"H8113J","gloss":"Shimri","relation":"H8113J ="}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}